{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The set of points satisfying the pair of inequalities <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/5/e15212f428139e820c2b195d5a5e2a6dbe22fdc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ac3c604da70a65f2dc5d847fd7e713961ff4d57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;4-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" /> is contained entirely in quadrants:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/098d6775cf10ee6733dd4bb44f5aea3540571824.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{I and II}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{II and III}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{I and III}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{III and IV}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{I and IV}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"629\" height=\"17\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d6f3e0047318d2940e25e439a2ce5999da20deb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] fill((-1,5)--(5,5)--(5,-1)--cycle,red); fill((2.5,5)--(-5,5)--(-5,-5)--(-2.5,-5)--cycle,cyan); fill((-1,5)--(4/3,8/3)--(2.5,5)--cycle,magenta); draw((-1,5)--(5,-1),dotted,Arrows); draw((-2.5,-5)--(2.5,5),dotted,Arrows);  import graph; size(8.22 cm); real lsf=0.5; pen dps=linewidth(0.7)+fontsize(10); defaultpen(dps); pen ds=black; real xmin=-5.2,xmax=5.2,ymin=-5.2,ymax=5.2;  pen cqcqcq=rgb(0.75,0.75,0.75), evevff=rgb(0.9,0.9,1), zzttqq=rgb(0.6,0.2,0);   /*grid*/ pen gs=linewidth(0.7)+cqcqcq+linetype(&quot;2 2&quot;); real gx=1,gy=1; for(real i=ceil(xmin/gx)*gx;i&lt;=floor(xmax/gx)*gx;i+=gx) draw((i,ymin)--(i,ymax),gs); for(real i=ceil(ymin/gy)*gy;i&lt;=floor(ymax/gy)*gy;i+=gy) draw((xmin,i)--(xmax,i),gs);  Label laxis; laxis.p=fontsize(10);  xaxis(xmin,xmax,defaultpen+black,Ticks(laxis,Step=1.0,Size=2,NoZero),Arrows(6),above=true); yaxis(ymin,ymax,defaultpen+black,Ticks(laxis,Step=1.0,Size=2,NoZero),Arrows(6),above=true); clip((xmin,ymin)--(xmin,ymax)--(xmax,ymax)--(xmax,ymin)--cycle);  [/asy]\" width=\"392\" height=\"392\" />\nGraph both equations.  The solution to the system of inequalities is the magenta area because it is in both of the solutions of each individual inequality.  From the graph, the magenta area is in quadrants <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/3/af3906651d16a548230a504127bc5b308a64068f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$II$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>The inequalities are\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/2/ee23bfa0db11577302e7b4ec5cae35d497d49a19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;2x\\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad y&gt;4-x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"229\" height=\"17\" />\nso every solution lies above both lines. The boundary lines meet where\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/556895fd3372511724038b494e89f3b5e1e973f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x=4-x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"17\" />\nwhich gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b2b6e79fba58f3f9bd9888b8fd02a2c8b152d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"64\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/b/0bbda2d05996867a99b7cf6f240cfac136538ad4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=8/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" />. This intersection is the lowest point of the upper boundary, and it is above the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis. Hence every point satisfying both inequalities has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf32406671fc9a01b1982019404e3f981a0f56b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>Such points can have either positive or negative <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, so the solution set lies only in Quadrants I and II.\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12<